            "notes": "# Round III\n\n\u2b50Go for [Chop Chop](item_6f404c88-210f-473d-a7e6-e03547a074b8)!\n\n\u274cGet rid of  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) if needed, since you'll focus on [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) anyway.\n\n\u2705[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) together with  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) and [Bigger Magnet](item_c0acbb75-6f00-4736-9bb9-c144e168f511) boost your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) to a respectable level. \n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fIf you have trouble surviving try [Scav Scraps](item_b24d8c46-7022-49e2-b50d-7cc20a27fb05),  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643),  [Thick Skull](item_e255e348-1875-49d8-bf41-833fc5bbe4de) or  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) boosting your sustain by giving you **Armor**, **Lifesteal** or **Overhealth**. I prefer [Scav Scraps](item_b24d8c46-7022-49e2-b50d-7cc20a27fb05).",
