            "notes": "# Round V\n\n\u2b50Go for [Bloodcrazed](item_9ac9b9a7-793d-4f2f-9447-4b55ba7bc3f5) for a more constistent and tanky playstyle or [Bow Down](item_0673e9ed-37dd-4e58-acef-77e0fbe613fb) for a game changing ultimate and clutch moments!\n\n\u274cGet rid of [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) if needed.\n\n\u2705Now is the time to invest in [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you haven't already. It's crucial for your kit, as it significantly increases your chance to confirm kills by constantly applying a **Healing Reduction** debuff and boosting your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).\n\n\ud83d\udcccIf you want to maximize DPS go for [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) giving you a HUGE boost in [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). \n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0fIf you have trouble surviving try [Scav Scraps](item_b24d8c46-7022-49e2-b50d-7cc20a27fb05),  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643),  [Thick Skull](item_e255e348-1875-49d8-bf41-833fc5bbe4de) or  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) boosting your sustain by giving you **Armor**, **Lifesteal** or **Overhealth**. I prefer [Scav Scraps](item_b24d8c46-7022-49e2-b50d-7cc20a27fb05).",
